    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of many young people starting an internship at a big corporation, trying to survive work life day by day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose one of the characters which are playable right from the start and gain experience and money by defeating your coworkers. Combine character traits, items and perks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to unlock all the characters, items etc. and defeat the CTO, CFO and the Scrum Master at the end of your internship.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of many young people starting an internship at a big corporation, trying to survive work life day by day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose one of the characters which are playable right from the start and gain experience and money by defeating your coworkers. Combine character traits, items and perks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to unlock all the characters, items etc. and defeat the CTO, CFO and the Scrum Master at the end of your internship.</p>",
